**Tracking-start sentence is not asserted**

Failure: the report can drop the statement that summary-only findings are tracked from 2026-10-17 and every test still passes. Add:
```js
test('the report states when summary-only tracking starts', () => {
  assert.match(render(analyze(mixed())), /Summary-only findings are tracked from SpecGuard #233 \(2026-10-17\)/);
});
```

